  m_Name: 10Ekim
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  etiket: dayc
  aciklama:
  - "Bu aya, ekim yap\u0131l\u0131p tarlalar s\xFCr\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFC i\xE7in Ekim
    ad\u0131 verilmi\u015Ftir. Art\u0131k ona g\xF6re ekip bi\xE7ersin..."
  - "Ayn\u0131sefa (\u015Famdan \xE7i\xE7e\u011Fi) ad\u0131 da verilen, \xE7ift renkli,
    papatya benzeri o g\xFCzel \xE7i\xE7ekleri ekmek i\xE7in en uygun olan ayda d\xFCnyaya
    gelmi\u015Fsin {{isim}}. Bu \xE7i\xE7ek, d\xF6kt\xFC\u011F\xFC tohumlardan ertesi
    sene tekrar \xE7\u0131kar ve \u015Fifal\u0131d\u0131r."
  aranacakEtiket: dgun
